## Key Implementation Decisions

### Architecture
- **State Management**: Using Zustand for all client-side state (no React Query yet - reserved for future API)
- **Navigation**: React Navigation with Bottom Tabs + Stack Navigator
- **UI Library**: React Native Paper
- **Theme**: Custom theme with primary color `#2ecc71` (green)

### File Structure
- All app code in `/app` directory
- Screens in `/app/screens`
- Components in `/app/components` ✅ (Chunk 5 complete - ReceiptCard)
- Services in `/app/services` ✅ (Chunk 4 complete - OCR and receipt services)
- Types in `/app/types` ✅ (Chunk 2 complete)
- Store in `/app/store` ✅ (Chunk 2 complete - Zustand stores)
- Utils in `/app/utils` ✅ (Chunk 2 complete - mock data generators)

### Current State Management
- ✅ Zustand stores created (Chunk 2):
  - `useReceiptStore` - Manages receipts and receipt items
  - `useShoppingListStore` - Manages shopping lists and items
  - `useUserStore` - Manages user state (simple for now)
- All data stored in Zustand stores using local state
- Mock services will be used until backend is ready
- Mock data generators available for testing

### Navigation Flow
```
Login Screen (dummy) 
  → Main Stack
    → HomeTabs (Bottom Tabs)
      - Home
      - Receipts
      - Shopping
      - Analytics
      - Profile
    → Stack Screens
      - ReceiptDetail
      - UploadReceipt
      - ShoppingListDetail
      - PriceComparisonResult
```

